{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "往", "id": "往"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "戰", "id": "戰"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "追", "id": "追"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.136136885356381, "source": "義", "target": "戰"}, {"weight": 1.8484548129046001, "source": "義", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 2.5416019934645457, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.5416019934645457, "source": "義", "target": "勝"}, {"weight": 1.6253112615903906, "source": "義", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 2.136136885356381, "source": "義", "target": "往"}, {"weight": 1.442989704796436, "source": "義", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 1.548350220454262, "source": "至", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.646962509122372, "source": "至", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 1.7996646487351682, "source": "至", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, "source": "至", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.7455747977904816, "source": "往", "target": "追"}, {"weight": 1.6661332561106457, "source": "亂", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 1.6661332561106457, "source": "亂", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 1.5119825762833874, "source": "亂", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.07159836421881, "source": "亂", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.7647455447787554, "source": "亂", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 1.3784511836588647, "source": "亂", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, 